# The sound release. Along this exact recording the game issues 35
# sound_effect calls, every number present in the sidecar blb, all
# passing in the conforming quiet (§9, §11.1): the dream chant
# (10) crescendos volume 2-4-6-8 and stops at the wake-up; the
# rats (4) swell until the valve blast silences them; the lab
# summoning (13) rises until the trapdoor; the wires' hum (15)
# starts in the Large Chamber and is stopped by the bolt cutter;
# the finale layers 11/16 at the socket, 12 (with a prepare) for
# the creature, 8/9 over the hatching, then a global stop and
# unload. When sound playback arrives, this file is its test plan.

i
read assignment
drop assignment
sit at pc
examine pc
turn on pc

